  "full_response": "Here’s a professional and clear **Hotel Reservation Confirmation** template that includes all the requested details:\n\n---\n\n**[Hotel Logo]**\n**Hotel Name**\n123 Hospitality Lane, City, State, ZIP Code\nPhone: (123) 456-7890 | Email: reservations@hotelname.com\nWebsite: www.hotelname.com\n\n---\n\n### **RESERVATION CONFIRMATION**\n**Confirmation Number:** RES-2024-05678\n**Date Issued:** [Today’s Date]\n\n---\n\n**Guest Information:**\n- **Full Name:** John A. Doe\n- **Email:** john.doe@example.com\n- **Phone Number:** (555) 123-4567\n- **Credit Card on File (Last 4 Digits):** **** **** **** 1234\n\n**ReservationCheck-In Date:** June 15, 2024 (After 3:00 PM)\n- **Check-Out Date:** June 18, 2024 (Before 11:00 AM)\n- **Room Type:** Deluxe King Room\n- **Number of Guests:** 2 Adults\n- **Special Requests:** High floor, non-smoking\n\n**Charges Summary:**\n- **Room Rate (3 Nights):** $299.00/night x 3 = **$897.00**\n- **Taxes & Fees:** **$107.64**\n- **Total Amount Charged:** **$1,004.64**\n\n**Cancellation Policy:**\n- Cancellations must be made 48 hours prior to check-in to avoid a one-night penalty.\n\n**Additional Information:**\n- Complimentary Wi-Fi and breakfast included.\n- Parking available for $25/day (valet) or $15/day (self-parking).\n- Contact the front desk for early check-in or late check-out requests.\n\n---\n\n**Thank you for choosing [Hotel Name]!**\nWe look forward to welcoming you. For questions or modifications, reply to this email or call (123) 456-7890.\n\n**Need to modify or cancel?** [Click here] or visit [www.hotelname.com/manage-reservation](https://www.hotelname.com/manage-reservation).\n\n---\n\n**",
